  "sepolia-sequencer.giwa.io": "write-only: eth_sendRawTransaction passes the whitelist (malformed payloads come back as -32602 parse/RLP errors), while every read and every MEV/bundle method returns HTTP 403 -32601 'rpc method is not whitelisted'",
